WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:02.300
Plan your route before you go.

00:02.390 --> 00:06.450
In MapNero, choose a visible, writable layer
and open Route Builder.

00:06.730 --> 00:09.800
Move the crosshair and add at least two waypoints.

00:09.830 --> 00:12.400
Check the distance, then save to the layer.

00:12.420 --> 00:14.220
This connects your chosen points.

00:14.230 --> 00:16.400
It doesn't find a road automatically.

00:16.410 --> 00:18.200
Guides at mapnero dot com.
